      "writtenOn": "2018-01-17T18:12:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Based on this, it looks like assignment list is a list of dictionaries, which are the role references. We have a utility method in common that removes duplicate dictionaries from a list. We had a bug this release or last release with code very similar to this that wasn\u0027t removing duplicates because of dictionary ordering (which set doesn\u0027t seem to account for).\n\nhttps://github.com/openstack/keystone/blob/28abf3e44b0319c7a2f7f86392e1362bac10bf93/keystone/common/utils.py#L123\n\nWe might be able to do something like:\n\n  def _get_user_roles(self, user_id, project_id):\n      assignment_list \u003d PROVIDERS.assignment_api.list_role_assignments(\n          user_id\u003duser_id, project_id\u003dproject_id, effective\u003dTrue\n      )\n      return utils.remove_duplicate_dicts_by_id(assignment_list)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 82,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 82,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "39f2241ea8800292e9a11a80a6e8ee85f06b51d8",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7f96bb07_207c7eea",
        "filename": "keystone/application_credential/core.py",
        "patchSetId": 34
      },
      "lineNbr": 82,
      "author": {
        "id": 8482
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-17T19:25:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The thing is that the end result here is a list of ids, but the output of that method is a list of dictionaries. In order to use that it would have to look something like this:\n\n return [r[\u0027id\u0027] for r in utils.remove_duplicate_dicts_by_id(\n            [{\u0027id\u0027: a[\u0027role_id\u0027]} for a in assignment_list])]\n\nwhich is a bit verbose but not the worst",
      "parentUuid": "7f96bb07_5a209df7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 82,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 82,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "39f2241ea8800292e9a11a80a6e8ee85f06b51d8",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
