      "writtenOn": "2018-01-17T18:12:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If it\u0027s possible to create an application credential without roles, we might need to check that there is at least one thing in user_roles.",
      "revId": "39f2241ea8800292e9a11a80a6e8ee85f06b51d8",
